      "type": "verse",
      "text": "1             So now there is no condemnation for those who belong to Christ Jesus.",
      "reference": "- Romans 8:1 NLT"
    },
    {
      "vkey": "v_3gqoi3s7y7e",
      "left": "9073.58px",
      "top": "8911.13px",
      "zIndex": "1619",
      "type": "note",
      "html": "Romans 8:1 declares a present-tense not-guilty verdict for everyone who is in Christ Jesus."
    },
    {
      "vkey": "v_e9aohtzrdhp",
      "left": "9907.35px",
      "top": "8895.55px",
      "zIndex": "1621",
      "type": "note",
      "html": "The phrase \"in Christ Jesus\" shows that freedom from condemnation depends on our union with Christ, not our performance."
    },
    {
      "vkey": "v_vi7r1d93kn",
      "left": "10409.2px",
      "top": "9040.24px",
      "zIndex": "1647",
      "type": "verse",
      "text": "Therefore, since we have been made right in God’s sight by faith, we have peace with God because of what Jesus Christ our Lord has done for us.",
      "reference": "- Romans 5:1 NLT"
    },
